{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794539621047,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc364ffeqbG9co4b48ZLH6","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2e58887001Wn5FP4h1d0gU0r","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc364ffeqbG9co4b48ZLH6","messageID":"msg_1d2e54f7a0012yC08YUOo3LsIC","type":"tool","id":"call_3ef7e43c61244c75ba4af960","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/tasks.md","offset":55,"limit":50},"output":"Read file specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/tasks.md, lines 55-103\n55: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n56: ## Phase 3: Verification\n57: \n58: - [x] T009 Write the packet documents and register this child in the parent phase table (`spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `../spec.md`). Verify: `validate.sh --strict` on this folder prints `RESULT: PASSED`.\n59: - [ ] T010 Fill the `Disposition` cell of every row in the table below (`tasks.md`). Verify: no row of the table has an empty `Disposition` cell.\n60: <!-- /ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n61: \n62: ---\n63: \n64: ### Disposition Table\n65: \n66: The 14 ranked recommendations of `research/research.md` section 9, in rank order. A `Disposition` value is either `built in <phase>` or `declined: <reason>`.\n67: \n68: | Rank | Recommendation | Disposition |\n69: |------|----------------|-------------|\n70: | 1 | Put Codex hook approval in the install path and add a doctor check | |\n71: | 2 | Record the offer with `offeredCommand` and `offeredPolicy` in the diagnostic record and each arm run line | |\n72: | 3 | Make the scorer report an attributable rate with capped runs excluded and a per-policy split | |\n73: | 4 | Remove the cold-start fail-open with a SessionStart warm-up and a probe timeout below the hook budget | |\n74: | 5 | Make DSH reachable in the install guide and default its prompt advisor on | |\n75: | 6 | Check the target repository's hook wiring on first run | |\n76: | 7 | Name the command document path in the head on hosts without a folder-style registry | |\n77: | 8 | Bind the command's run or ask policy to the skill path that runs the same workflow | |\n78: | 9 | Settle G5 on the real path and guard it with a per-runtime visibility count | |\n79: | 10 | Fix the argued-route document lookup in the transcript scorer | |\n80: | 11 | Thread the 750 ms embed deadline into the adapter as a real abort | |\n81: | 12 | Surface hook health and add a prove-it install step | |\n82: | 13 | Collapse the host-adapter spawn and the CLI spawn, only after the rank 4 cold-start measurement | |\n83: | 14 | Small guards for spelling, the once-per-command clause, head length, brief cost, read cost and write targets | |\n84: \n85: ---\n86: \n87: <!-- ANCHOR:completion -->\n88: ## Completion Criteria\n89: \n90: - [ ] All tasks marked `[x]`\n91: - [ ] No `[B]` blocked tasks remaining\n92: - [ ] Every row of the disposition table has a value\n93: <!-- /ANCHOR:completion -->\n94: \n95: ---\n96: \n97: <!-- ANCHOR:cross-refs -->\n98: ## Cross-References\n99: \n100: - **Specification**: See `spec.md`\n101: - **Plan**: See `plan.md`\n102: - **Research**: See `research/research.md`\n103: <!-- /ANCHOR:cross-refs -->","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/tasks.md, lines 55-103\n55: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n56: ## Phase 3: Verification\n57: \n58: - [x] T009 Write the packet documents and register this child in the parent phase table (`spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `../spec.md`). Verify: `validate.sh --strict` on this folder prints `RESULT: PASSED`.\n59: - [ ] T010 Fill the `Disposition` cell of every row in the table below (`tasks.md`). Verify: no row of the table has an empty `Disposition` cell.\n60: <!-- /ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n61: \n62: ---\n63: \n64: ### Disposition Table\n65: \n66: The 14 ranked recommendations of `research/research.md` section 9, in rank order. A `Disposition` value is either `built in <phase>` or `declined: <reason>`.\n67: \n68: | Rank | Recommendation | Disposition |\n69: |------|----------------|-------------|\n70: | 1 | Put Codex hook approval in the install path and add a doctor check | |\n71: | 2 | Record the offer with `offeredCommand` and `offeredPolicy` in the diagnostic record and each arm run line | |\n72: | 3 | Make the scorer report an attributable rate with capped runs excluded and a per-policy split | |\n73: | 4 | Remove the cold-start fail-open with a SessionStart warm-up and a probe timeout below the hook budget | |\n74: | 5 | Make DSH reachable in the install guide and default its prompt advisor on | |\n75: | 6 | Check the target repository's hook wiring on first run | |\n76: | 7 | Name the command document path in the head on hosts without a folder-style registry | |\n77: | 8 | Bind the command's run or ask policy to the skill path that runs the same workflow | |\n78: | 9 | Settle G5 on the real path and guard it with a per-runtime visibility count | |\n79: | 10 | Fix the argued-route document lookup in the transcript scorer | |\n80: | 11 | Thread the 750 ms embed deadline into the adapter as a real abort | |\n81: | 12 | Surface hook health and add a prove-it install step | |\n82: | 13 | Collapse the host-adapter spawn and the CLI spawn, only after the rank 4 cold-start measurement | |\n83: | 14 | Small guards for spelling, the once-per-command clause, head length, brief cost, read cost and write targets | |\n84: \n85: ---\n86: \n87: <!-- ANCHOR:completion -->\n88: ## Completion Criteria\n89: \n90: - [ ] All tasks marked `[x]`\n91: - [ ] No `[B]` blocked tasks remaining\n92: - [ ] Every row of the disposition table has a value\n93: <!-- /ANCHOR:completion -->\n94: \n95: ---\n96: \n97: <!-- ANCHOR:cross-refs -->\n98: ## Cross-References\n99: \n100: - **Specification**: See `spec.md`\n101: - **Plan**: See `plan.md`\n102: - **Research**: See `research/research.md`\n103: <!-- /ANCHOR:cross-refs -->"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/tasks.md\",\"offset\":55,\"limit\":50}"},"time":{"start":1794539620487,"end":1794539621047}}}}
