{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794540075516,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc364ffeqbG9co4b48ZLH6","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2ec7739001GzqOx0c5Gkm8B0","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc364ffeqbG9co4b48ZLH6","messageID":"msg_1d2ec4fc00016jOJEh76G1SPsw","type":"tool","id":"call_5c4ab32f76894be685ff5c63","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n -i \"262|304|MB|memory|disk|pull|cost\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml 2>/dev/null | head -25; ls .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/ | grep -i embedder"},"output":"2:# DOCTOR: SKILL-ADVISOR EMBEDDER SETUP WORKFLOW (INTERACTIVE MUTATING MODE)\n5:purpose: Find what is missing for local meaning matching, show every missing step with its cost and its undo, ask once, run only the approved steps and prove the semantic lane is on\n6:action: Probe Ollama, the model and the advisor -> print the plan with a cost and an undo per missing step -> approval -> start the server and pull the model -> skill graph scan -> probe again -> final result\n21:# EMBEDDER SETUP INVARIANT\n23:embedder_setup_invariant: |\n25:  nomic-embed-text:v1.5 model pulled and a skill graph scan that writes the command\n28:  make and the install guide owns its cost. It starts the server and pulls the\n31:  pulled, started or written before the approval, and a dry run stops after the\n42:  cost_script: \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs\"\n53:  dry_run: \"--dry-run prints the plan with each missing step's cost and undo, then stops with STATUS=OK before the approval. Nothing is pulled, started or written (default false).\"\n70:    - \"the Ollama model store, one pulled copy of nomic-embed-text:v1.5 only\"\n78:    - \"any second model pull and any model removal\"\n90:      - \"When the version answers, run `curl -sS --max-time 5 <url>/api/tags` and look for `nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. A missing tag is the missing pull step.\"\n92:      - \"Read `semanticLaneHealth.laneEnabled`, `semanticLaneHealth.activeEmbedder` and `semanticLaneHealth.commandVectorCoverage` to decide whether the scan step is still missing. A null active embedder or an embedded count of zero is the missing scan step.\"\n99:      - active_embedder: \"object|null|unread\"\n103:    purpose: \"Print one line per missing step with its cost and its undo, through the presentation contract\"\n106:      - \"Run `node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs` when `/api/version` answered, and keep its JSON. Exit 2 means the server stopped answering after the probe, so take the cost from the install guide and say the live measurement was unavailable.\"\n108:      - \"For each missing step, print one plan row through the presentation contract's plan table with columns step, cost and undo. Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\"\n109:      - \"Never print a cost the measurement or the install guide did not produce. Never offer an undo the operator cannot run.\"\n115:      - \"If dry_run is true, render the presentation contract's dry-run result from the plan's own rows and stop with STATUS=OK. A dry run asks nothing, pulls nothing, starts nothing and writes nothing.\"\n116:      - \"Ask the presentation contract's approval prompt once, naming the model pull, the background server start when it is listed and the database the scan writes.\"\n117:      - \"Approve is the only answer that proceeds. Anything else is a no: render the presentation contract's cancelled result, state that nothing was pulled, started or written, and stop with STATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled.\"\n125:      - \"When the start step is missing, run `ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\"\n126:      - \"When the pull step is missing, run `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\"\n127:      - \"Never pull a model the plan did not list, never remove a model and never restart a server this run did not start.\"\ndoctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2:# DOCTOR: SKILL-ADVISOR EMBEDDER SETUP WORKFLOW (INTERACTIVE MUTATING MODE)\n5:purpose: Find what is missing for local meaning matching, show every missing step with its cost and its undo, ask once, run only the approved steps and prove the semantic lane is on\n6:action: Probe Ollama, the model and the advisor -> print the plan with a cost and an undo per missing step -> approval -> start the server and pull the model -> skill graph scan -> probe again -> final result\n21:# EMBEDDER SETUP INVARIANT\n23:embedder_setup_invariant: |\n25:  nomic-embed-text:v1.5 model pulled and a skill graph scan that writes the command\n28:  make and the install guide owns its cost. It starts the server and pulls the\n31:  pulled, started or written before the approval, and a dry run stops after the\n42:  cost_script: \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs\"\n53:  dry_run: \"--dry-run prints the plan with each missing step's cost and undo, then stops with STATUS=OK before the approval. Nothing is pulled, started or written (default false).\"\n70:    - \"the Ollama model store, one pulled copy of nomic-embed-text:v1.5 only\"\n78:    - \"any second model pull and any model removal\"\n90:      - \"When the version answers, run `curl -sS --max-time 5 <url>/api/tags` and look for `nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. A missing tag is the missing pull step.\"\n92:      - \"Read `semanticLaneHealth.laneEnabled`, `semanticLaneHealth.activeEmbedder` and `semanticLaneHealth.commandVectorCoverage` to decide whether the scan step is still missing. A null active embedder or an embedded count of zero is the missing scan step.\"\n99:      - active_embedder: \"object|null|unread\"\n103:    purpose: \"Print one line per missing step with its cost and its undo, through the presentation contract\"\n106:      - \"Run `node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs` when `/api/version` answered, and keep its JSON. Exit 2 means the server stopped answering after the probe, so take the cost from the install guide and say the live measurement was unavailable.\"\n108:      - \"For each missing step, print one plan row through the presentation contract's plan table with columns step, cost and undo. Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\"\n109:      - \"Never print a cost the measurement or the install guide did not produce. Never offer an undo the operator cannot run.\"\n115:      - \"If dry_run is true, render the presentation contract's dry-run result from the plan's own rows and stop with STATUS=OK. A dry run asks nothing, pulls nothing, starts nothing and writes nothing.\"\n116:      - \"Ask the presentation contract's approval prompt once, naming the model pull, the background server start when it is listed and the database the scan writes.\"\n117:      - \"Approve is the only answer that proceeds. Anything else is a no: render the presentation contract's cancelled result, state that nothing was pulled, started or written, and stop with STATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled.\"\n125:      - \"When the start step is missing, run `ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\"\n126:      - \"When the pull step is missing, run `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\"\n127:      - \"Never pull a model the plan did not list, never remove a model and never restart a server this run did not start.\"\ndoctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n -i \\\"262|304|MB|memory|disk|pull|cost\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml 2>/dev/null | head -25; ls .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/ | grep -i embedder\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540074809,"end":1794540075516}}}}
