ent-efd4d8fc-5dae-4c70-be53-831aad79634f\",\"event_type\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"event_version\":1,\"stream_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"stream_sequence\":4,\"committed_at\":\"2026-11-13T03:26:43.958Z\",\"canonicalEventHash\":\"9a95883483db9c5e4552873d1ef98b7af8cf69255ef4cffc02bfb2d6b1df3663\",\"recordHash\":\"8625818416e751c6fb5406c174c1d763596d1b682d1b549733365cda090d184f\",\"authorizationRef\":{\"audit_ledger_id\":\"deep-research-audit-ledger\",\"audit_sequence\":5,\"audit_record_hash\":\"d81e522ea05e08a5b53147fb3262e19015d4326ee89e971d008229b3405ebc1a\",\"decision_id\":\"decision-5ee1d5bc-6b1e-4d67-b214-c06d705ef866\",\"decision_digest\":\"83dbf987e94b410cfd4988bccad879701d8ffd93556108659151636a04835723\",\"request_digest\":\"92e05319882227af39439565838b059d538cc106710c3a07b9d573f588494878\",\"policy_digest\":\"a4b1c20c36f40aa5f6c82a50e7fb20354deda901fb7b2be8f51dc112f221c7dd\",\"authority_epoch\":1,\"fence_token\":4},\"ledgerId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"eventId\":\"event-efd4d8fc-5dae-4c70-be53-831aad79634f\",\"eventType\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"eventVersion\":1,\"streamId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"streamSequence\":4,\"committedAt\":\"2026-11-13T03:26:43.958Z\"},\"projectionRefreshed\":true,\"projectionError\":null,\"warnings\":[\"Trusted evidence yield was absent and remains explicitly zero.\"]}\n[deep-research] detected 5 legacy-import question(s) in key-questions; append external questions to research/inbox.jsonl instead.\n{\n  \"registryPath\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-2/findings-registry.json\",\n  \"dashboardPath\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/linea