{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794540412028,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc364ffeqbG9co4b48ZLH6","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2f19833001hH4eV9C5IZpIhK","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc364ffeqbG9co4b48ZLH6","messageID":"msg_1d2f18839001NIWUbHRzNk7e9k","type":"tool","id":"call_d32718875cc0457d9ee4b4de","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-2 && sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' $L/deep-research-strategy.md && echo \"== dashboard head ==\" && sed -n '1,40p' $L/deep-research-dashboard.md"},"output":"<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] KQ1: Which words in the delivered brief and its policy definition reach the model, and which reach only AGENTS.md?\n- [x] KQ2: What does the brief cost per prompt after phase 005, and which repeated bytes can move to once per session?\n- [x] KQ3: What must an external repository install do so a plain request gets an offered command with a usable policy?\n- [x] KQ4: Should the semantic embedder be kept warm, and at what memory and latency cost against the 750 ms deadline?\n- [x] KQ5: Which ranked changes raise started-when-useful per unit of risk without lowering any floor?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n== dashboard head ==\n---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard\ndescription: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nReducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: UX and cost lane: what the person and the model read and what it costs after phases 005, 006, 008 and 010 are built and 011 is being built — brief wording and bytes, ask and start wording, install and setup for an external repository, embedder keep-alive against cold start\n- Started: 2026-11-13T05:05:00Z\n- Status: INITIALIZED\n- Iteration: 3 of 4\n- Session ID: fanout-ux-cost-2-1794539443568-6stapj\n- Parent Session: none\n- Lifecycle Mode: new\n- Generation: 1\n- continuedFromRun: none\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:status -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:progress -->\n## 3. PROGRESS\n\n| # | Focus | Track | Ratio | Findings | Status |\n|---|-------|-------|-------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | KQ1 and KQ2: the brief words and bytes, where the run/start/ask definition lives, and what the constant block costs per prompt | ux-cost | 0.62 | 8 | complete |\n| 2 | KQ3: the external-repository install path, the two instruction-file shapes, and the install's final status against measured brief delivery | install-setup | 0.72 | 7 | complete |\n| 3 | KQ4 and KQ5: the embedder cold start and keep-alive decision, and the five-item ranking by expected gain per unit of risk | embedder-cost | 0.60 | 11 | complete |\n\n- iterationsCompleted: 3\n- keyFindings: 26\n- openQuestions: 0\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] KQ1: Which words in the delivered brief and its policy definition reach the model, and which reach only AGENTS.md?\n- [x] KQ2: What does the brief cost per prompt after phase 005, and which repeated bytes can move to once per session?\n- [x] KQ3: What must an external repository install do so a plain request gets an offered command with a usable policy?\n- [x] KQ4: Should the semantic embedder be kept warm, and at what memory and latency cost against the 750 ms deadline?\n- [x] KQ5: Which ranked changes raise started-when-useful per unit of risk without lowering any floor?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n== dashboard head ==\n---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard\ndescription: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nReducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: UX and cost lane: what the person and the model read and what it costs after phases 005, 006, 008 and 010 are built and 011 is being built — brief wording and bytes, ask and start wording, install and setup for an external repository, embedder keep-alive against cold start\n- Started: 2026-11-13T05:05:00Z\n- Status: INITIALIZED\n- Iteration: 3 of 4\n- Session ID: fanout-ux-cost-2-1794539443568-6stapj\n- Parent Session: none\n- Lifecycle Mode: new\n- Generation: 1\n- continuedFromRun: none\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:status -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:progress -->\n## 3. PROGRESS\n\n| # | Focus | Track | Ratio | Findings | Status |\n|---|-------|-------|-------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | KQ1 and KQ2: the brief words and bytes, where the run/start/ask definition lives, and what the constant block costs per prompt | ux-cost | 0.62 | 8 | complete |\n| 2 | KQ3: the external-repository install path, the two instruction-file shapes, and the install's final status against measured brief delivery | install-setup | 0.72 | 7 | complete |\n| 3 | KQ4 and KQ5: the embedder cold start and keep-alive decision, and the five-item ranking by expected gain per unit of risk | embedder-cost | 0.60 | 11 | complete |\n\n- iterationsCompleted: 3\n- keyFindings: 26\n- openQuestions: 0\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-2 && sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' $L/deep-research-strategy.md && echo \\\"== dashboard head ==\\\" && sed -n '1,40p' $L/deep-research-dashboard.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540410931,"end":1794540412028}}}}
